{
  "project": {
    "name": "Mock-Neck Top",
    "slug": "mock-neck-top",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "A fitted knit top with a mock neck: a short stand collar (~50-70 mm) that stands at the neck without folding — distinct from a tall folding turtleneck. The band length is solved to the measured neckline so it eases on without gaps; front and back share the body width so the shoulder and side seams balance by construction. A soft-goods garment — no hardware. FC-200 long-tail (silhouette gap).\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "Un top de punto ajustado con cuello mock: un cuello alto corto (~50-70 mm) que se mantiene erguido sin doblarse — distinto de un cuello de tortuga alto que se dobla. El largo de la banda se resuelve al escote medido para que entre sin huecos; frente y espalda comparten el ancho del cuerpo, así que las costuras de hombro y lateral se equilibran por construcción. Una prenda textil — sin herrajes. Cola larga FC-200 (hueco de silueta).\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet",
      "fr": "Un haut en maille ajusté à col mock : un col droit court (~50-70 mm) qui se tient au cou sans se replier — distinct d'un col roulé haut qui se replie. La longueur de la bande est résolue à l'encolure mesurée pour qu'elle s'enfile sans écarts ; le devant et le dos partagent la largeur du corps, de sorte que les coutures d'épaule et de côté s'équilibrent par construction. Un vêtement textile — sans quincaillerie. Longue traîne FC-200 (silhouette manquante).\n\nVisualiseur et configurateur officiel : Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "mock-neck",
      "top",
      "knit",
      "stand-collar",
      "commons",
      "made-to-measure"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "modes": [
    {
      "id": "set",
      "label": {
        "en": "Full Top",
        "es": "Top completo",
        "fr": "Haut complet"
      },
      "script_file": "main.py",
      "pieces": [
        "front",
        "back",
        "band"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pieces": [
    {
      "id": "front",
      "label": {
        "en": "Front",
        "es": "Frente",
        "fr": "Devant"
      },
      "default_color": "#6a5a5a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "back",
      "label": {
        "en": "Back",
        "es": "Espalda",
        "fr": "Dos"
      },
      "default_color": "#6a5a5a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "band",
      "label": {
        "en": "Mock-neck band",
        "es": "Banda de cuello mock",
        "fr": "Bande de col montant"
      },
      "default_color": "#5a4a4a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameter_groups": [
    {
      "id": "body",
      "label": {
        "en": "Body Measurements",
        "es": "Medidas Corporales",
        "fr": "Mesures du corps"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fit",
      "label": {
        "en": "Fit & Style",
        "es": "Ajuste y Estilo",
        "fr": "Coupe et style"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "construction",
      "label": {
        "en": "Construction",
        "es": "Construcción",
        "fr": "Construction"
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameters": [
    {
      "id": "chest_girth",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "body",
      "default": 940,
      "min": 640,
      "max": 1500,
      "step": 10,
      "measurement": {
        "standard": "iso_8559",
        "code": "chest_bust_girth"
      },
      "label": {
        "en": "Chest girth (mm)",
        "es": "Contorno de pecho (mm)",
        "fr": "Tour de poitrine (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Full chest",
        "es": "Pecho completo",
        "fr": "Tour de poitrine complet"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "top_length",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "body",
      "default": 620,
      "min": 420,
      "max": 880,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Length (mm)",
        "es": "Largo (mm)",
        "fr": "Longueur (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Shoulder to hem",
        "es": "Del hombro al ruedo",
        "fr": "De l'épaule à l'ourlet"
      }
    },
    {
